zlyme-initramfs
===============

Tiny static busybox plus /init, embedded in the kernel Image.

Busybox 1.36.1 is GPL-2.0. The kconfig and recipe layout come from
Knulli knulli-initramfs (Batocera/Knulli, GPL-2.0). /init is a Zlyme
simplification of Knulli's init (no overlay, squashfs file named
zlyme on LABEL=ZLYMEBOOT).

  https://busybox.net/
  https://github.com/knulli-cfw/distribution

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
